    {
      "key": "tc1aad10c7299b3c6",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is Lot Size in Forex? Standard, Mini and Micro Lots Explained</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什麼是外匯交易手數？標準手、迷你手和微型手詳解</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t41ba628a1b62eeb2",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Forex </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">lot size</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> is the standardized unit used to measure trade volume. A standard lot represents 100,000 units of the base currency, a mini lot 10,000 units, a micro lot 1,000 units, and a nano lot 100 units. Nano-sized trading is not available through every broker or instrument.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">外匯</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">手數</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">是用於衡量交易量的標準化單位。標準手代表 100,000 單位的基礎貨幣，迷你手代表 10,000 單位，微型手代表 1,000 單位，奈米手代表 100 單位。並非所有經紀商或工具都可以進行奈米級交易。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tab5944424c191b1a",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Lot size is one of the first trading mechanics worth understanding because it determines the amount of currency represented by a position and directly affects how much its value changes when the market moves.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">手數是最值得理解的交易機制之一，因為它決定了倉位所代表的貨幣數量，並直接影響其價值在市場變動時的變化程度。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t598333f39c1a022b",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A trader opening 1.00 lot has much greater market exposure than someone opening 0.01 lot in the same forex pair. As a result, the monetary effect of each pip is also larger.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">在同一外匯對中，開倉 1.00 手的交易者比開倉 0.01 手的交易者擁有更大的市場敞口。因此，每個點的貨幣效應也更大。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta9c919d4ab4bfaac",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Understanding forex lot size therefore connects several important concepts: position volume, pip value, margin, leverage and trade-level risk. This guide explains those relationships practically, including how Standard, Mini and Micro lots map to MT5 volume notation and how traders can calculate position size instead of selecting it arbitrarily.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">因此，瞭解外匯手數大小涉及幾個重要概念：頭寸量、點值、保證金、槓桿和交易水平風險。本指南以實際方式解釋了這些關係，包括標準手、迷你手和微型手如何對映到 MT5 交易量符號，以及交易者如何計算頭寸規模而不是任意選擇。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf44cbb1d2379b161",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is Lot Size in Forex?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什麼是外匯交易手數？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t76df17249a9eb6ce",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Lot size in forex is the standardized measure of transaction volume used when opening a forex position.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">外匯中的手數是開立外匯頭寸時使用的交易量的標準化衡量標準。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1de7ae7c1697833e",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">For forex pairs, the number of lots determines how many units of the base currency the trade represents.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">對於外匯貨幣對，手數決定了交易代表多少單位的基礎貨幣。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t0eb4a95834535748",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Under the standard forex convention:</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">根據標準外匯慣例：</span>"
    },
