      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">0.001手 = 100基礎貨幣單位（在支援奈米手交易的情況下）</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t8254c2ac10c38f48",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">This is the practical meaning behind terms such as lot size forex, forex lot size and trade volume. The lot does not tell you whether a position will gain or lose. It tells you how much market exposure the position represents.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">這是外匯手數、外匯交易手數和交易量等術語的實際含義。手數不會告訴您一個部位會盈利還是虧損，而是告訴您該部位代表多大的市場風險曝險。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t98aba6a0fdba5938",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The main forex lot sizes are Standard, Mini and Micro lots, representing 100,000, 10,000 and 1,000 base-currency units respectively.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">主要外匯手數為標準手數、迷你手數和微型手數，分別代表 100,000、10,000 和 1,000 個基礎貨幣單位。</span>"
    },
