        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">0.10 手 = 1 迷你手</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t0220a0e9dc7e1e59",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">This gives one-tenth of the exposure of a standard forex lot in the same currency pair.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">這相當於同一貨幣對中標準外匯手數的十分之一。</span>"
    },
