        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-calculate-forex-position-size-formula-lot-size-risk-examples"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">每點 0.10 美元</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t2af62924546df088",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">$0.01 per pip</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">每點 0.01 美元</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t6c1ee22eb900bfbe",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">For example, a 20-pip movement on EUR/USD would have a different monetary effect depending on volume:</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">例如，歐元/美元 20 點的波動會根據交易量產生不同的貨幣影響：</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td67c95bc1493883c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">1.00 lot: approximately $200</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">1.00 手：約 200 美元</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t51958572a969b02c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">0.10 lot: approximately $20</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">0.10 手：約 20 美元</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t606eeb6a35dfd91c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">0.01 lot: approximately $2</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">0.01 手：約 2 美元</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t649f534b0bfdf545",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Pip value is not always exactly the same in the account currency for every pair. Currency conversion can be required when the quote currency differs from the account currency.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">每對賬戶貨幣的點值並不總是完全相同。當報價貨幣與賬戶貨幣不同時，可能需要進行貨幣轉換。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t91aa5a8d21447561",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">That is why a lot size and pip calculator normally uses the pair, account currency and position size together.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">這就是為什麼手數和點值計算器通常同時使用貨幣對、賬戶貨幣和頭寸規模的原因。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t2a531adf667e7589",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A lot size is not automatically a fixed dollar amount.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">手數並不自動是固定的美元金額。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tfc4c4243a8b43767",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">0.01 lot = 1,000 EUR</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">0.01 手 = 1,000 歐元</span>"
    }
  ]
}
